      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْفِدٌ</span></b>  <i>Origin,</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْلٌ</span>, (S, K,) of a man;
(S) or in a general sense; (L;) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْتِدٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْكِدٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْقِدٌ</span>. (IAar.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And The <i>base,</i> or
<i>lower part,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْل</span>,) <i>of a camel's hump:</i> (IAar,
Yaakoob, S, M, K:) or the <i>hump itself.</i> (TA.)

